Package: wayfire
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: 3D wlroots-based Wayland compositor
 Wayfire is a Wayland compositor inspired by Compiz and built on wlroots. It
 aims to be customizable, extendable and lightweight without sacrificing its
 appearance.
 .
 This package contains the compositor, its bundled plugins and the session
 entry used by display managers.

Package: wayfire-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Depends:
 wayfire (= ${binary:Version}),
