 libwayland-dev,
 libxkbcommon-dev,
 ${misc:Depends},
Recommends:
 git,
 meson,
 ninja-build,
Description: 3D wlroots-based Wayland compositor (development files)
 Wayfire is a Wayland compositor inspired by Compiz and built on wlroots.
 .
 This package contains the headers and the pkg-config file required to build
 out-of-tree Wayfire plugins, and wayfire-plugin, which builds and installs them.
